{"t":"Magic Wall (Object)","s":"magic-wall-object-094ba","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Magic_Wall_Object_0f8b71.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Magic Wall (Object)</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Magic Wall (Object)\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Magic_Wall_Object_0f8b71.gif\" width=\"64\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Constructions<br/>Walls</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lightcolor\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Light</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #0000ff; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"></span><span style=\"margin: 0 0 0 0.4em;\">3 sqm</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"immobile\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Movable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6.4<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">November 2, 2001</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20140918101624&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Magic_Wall_Object_0f8b71.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a magic wall.<div class=\"p-weight\"></div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Paradox%20Tower\">Paradox Tower</a>, when using a <a href=\"#/wiki/Magic%20Wall%20Rune\">Magic Wall Rune</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>It also exists in a yellow color:<br/><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Magic Wall (Yellow)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Magic_Wall_Yellow_4b679a.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>.\n</p><p>On Open PvP and Retro Open PvP worlds, its color varies depending wether the caster and the viewer are on an active PvP situation or not. On <a href=\"#/wiki/Hardcore%20PvP\">Hardcore PvP</a> and Retro Hardcore PvP worlds it's always blue whereas on <a href=\"#/wiki/Optional%20PvP\">Optional PvP</a> worlds it will always appear be yellow when cast by players.\n</p><p>It is similar to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Rush%20Wood\">Rush Wood</a>, although it blocks all kinds of projectiles and spells unlike the Rush wood. They can be destroyed by walking over them on <a href=\"#/wiki/Optional%20PvP\">Optional PvP</a> worlds.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>Before Updates/10.55 it looked like this:<br/><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Magic Wall Effect (Old)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Magic_Wall_Effect_Old_a24216.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</p><p>The yellow version was implemented with the 10.00 Update.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/quest/25-years-of-tibia-quest\">25 Years of Tibia Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Brachiodemon\">Brachiodemon</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cloak%20of%20Terror\">Cloak of Terror</a></li><li>Constructions</li><li>Magic Wall (Neutral)</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Magic%20Wall%20Rune\">Magic Wall Rune</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Many%20Faces\">Many Faces</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rush%20Wood\">Rush Wood</a></li><li>Walls</li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["25-years-of-tibia-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"25-years-of-tibia-quest","quest":"25 Years of Tibia Quest","step":"8-3","n":33,"title":"Fase 4: Ferumbras Tower","kind":"mention","coords":[]}]}}